  m_text: '<size=125%><b>STEP 01 of 09 - <color=#ffd970>GREYBOX</color></b></size>

    Everything
    is plain grey so you can judge the <b>layout, scale and route</b> without colour
    or lighting distracting you.


    <b><color=#9fe3ff>TRY THIS</color></b>

    <size=92%>1.
    Walk the route and time it - is it too long or too short?

    2. Can you see
    the tower from the start? Why does that matter?

    3. Find one place where
    you''re not sure which way to go.</size>

    <size=88%><color=#ffd970>Press
    <b>G</b> in Play mode to read the full step guide.</color></size>'
